#   Bitrix24 -> Settings (gear icon) -> Developer tools -> Inbound webhooks -> Add
#   Permissions: IM (read+write), Open Lines (read+write)
#   Copy the URL: https://b24-g1b864.bitrix24.ru/rest/1/YOUR_TOKEN/
BITRIX_WEBHOOK=https://b24-g1b864.bitrix24.ru/rest/1/YOUR_TOKEN/

